# DIAGNOSTICS

Each returns `VX_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`.

# BUGS

None of the design's scheduling exists: no intents but `interactive`, no admission test, no donation through `channel_call`, no reservations, and no placement on heterogeneous cores.
